DESCRIPTION:Album Release "Hallo" // Gadermaier Solo Datum: 07.10.2026 | Einlass: 18:00 Uhr Beginn: 18:30 | Ende: Uhr  Synesthetic IVO: Dadaistic raps and invented words which celebrate a modern musical nihilism in an outlandish and humorous manner are Synesthetic Ivo’s trademark. In the debut album „1V0“ and the attached music video „YHLD“ he opens a door to experimental contemporary Hip Hop that stays wide open in his performances. For this release show Ivo is supported by the super group Synesthetic4. Robin Gadermaier\, born in Melk\, Lower Austria\, has been making waves in the Viennese jazz scene for several years. Stylistic range\, progressiveness on the instrument\, and sonic versatility are central to his artistic process. He takes the freedom to be active in both jazz and pop. For Robin Gadermaier\, the stage is one of the last places where one can truly be free. There\, his unconventional playing style stands out\, as he plays his bass on a stand in the classical acoustic-guitar position. donation with a minimum of 10€ start: 20:30 20:30 Robin Gadermaier solo Robin Gadermaier: bass 21:15 Synesthetic IVO "HALLO" album release Vincent Pongracz: clarinet\, vocals Peter Rom: guitar Manu Mayr: bass Andreas Lettner: drums https://www.robingadermaier.com
URL:https://rhiz.wien/copilotevent/07-10-2026_synesthetic-wednesday
END:VEVENT
